 humans, and sometimes witnesses. If you let them run scared, the black duck could be in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/b6feddf883375434e08d939724d7c7c4.avif?t=1764695011\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras_big/b6feddf883375434e08d939724d7c7c4.avif?t=1764695011 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normally no one notices the little duck's covert behavior, but sometimes there are attack NPCs that see through the duck's black magic, resulting in a battle. Run up, down, jump, and roll to avoid the attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras/40a38e5ed07192c8f573869e2262765c.avif?t=1764695011\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3320840/extras_big/40a38e5ed07192c8f573869e2262765c.avif?t=1764695011 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While 'Odile' is a story-heavy game, most of the text is delivered through the NPC's speech bubble without stopping gameplay. SCG dialogue events only come at a level where the story does not interfere with gameplay and helps you immerse yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform belt-scrolling action on three stages: the palace, the temple, and the tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And experience 28 multi-endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now play through the <i>Palace Route</i>, <i>Temple Route</i>, and Pub<i> Route</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all <strong>28 different endings</strong> that await you depending on your choices!</p>", "short_description": "Romance fantasy style action adventure 'Odile: Black Duckling Tale' i